# GitDeploy — repository hygiene
#
# Powered by Digitalbkk Co., Ltd. (www.digitalbkk.com)
#
# This vendor tree doubles as the live install on a running server
# (/usr/local/gitdeploy), so runtime droppings can appear here that must never
# reach git. Everything below is either something the installer/runtime writes
# into the tree, or an editor artefact.
#
# The authoritative "not source" list is install.sh's own stage-in rsync
# excludes (.git/, .gitignore, *.tmp, *.swp, .DS_Store) — this file is a
# superset of that.
#
# NOTE what is deliberately NOT ignored:
#   conf/github_known_hosts  — shipped source. install.sh refreshes it in place
#                              via ssh-keyscan and REFUSES to install if it is
#                              missing or empty, so the pinned copy must be
#                              committed. Expect it to show as modified after
#                              each install run; that is normal.
#   VERSION                  — shipped source, read by install.sh, check.sh,
#                              the panel UI and packaging/make-release.sh.
#   LICENSE, NOTICE          — Apache-2.0 requires both to travel with every
#                              distributed copy. Never ignore them.

# --- git / packaging -------------------------------------------------------
.git/
# Release artifacts, in case someone builds into the tree instead of outside it.
gitdeploy-*.tar.gz
gitdeploy-*.tar.gz.sha256
gitdeploy-*.zip

# --- installer / runtime temporaries ---------------------------------------
# install.sh mktemp's conf/.github_known_hosts.XXXXXX before mv'ing it into
# place; a crashed or interrupted run leaves the temp file behind.
conf/.github_known_hosts.*
# Generic atomic-write scratch names used across install.sh / uninstall.sh
# (<file>.gitdeploy.tmp.<pid>, <file>.tmp.<pid>).
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
*.gitdeploy.tmp.*

# --- backups ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.gitdeploy.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.pre-migration-*

# --- editor / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.*.swp
.*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- guards ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this package is ever npm-installed here (builds run in a per-user
# workspace under /home/<user>/.gitdeploy), but a developer poking at
# bin/detect.js could create these locally.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
